Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 16:31:32 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] impact: answer from the file graph for files with no
 symbols

CSS, HTML and other files without a grammar have a file-graph node but no
symbol node, so impact died at locate and never wrote the impact log. The
pre-edit gate blocks on the file graph, so those edits could never clear.
impact now falls back to the file graph's importers (transitive, --depth)
and records the entry. Test: scripts/impact-fallback.test.mjs.
